    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST NOW</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754540/extras/1183b612a76d2c84a585386667a4697f.poster.avif?t=1725219198\" width=494 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754540/extras/1183b612a76d2c84a585386667a4697f.webm?t=1725219198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754540/extras/1183b612a76d2c84a585386667a4697f.mp4?t=1725219198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Fox Quest is a puzzle game in which you use your ability to move between two dimensions to change one of them so that you can achieve a result in the other.<br>Move blocks, activate normal and magic mechanisms and help the fox to reach the goal!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754540/extras/7515d58d819f78ccfc198e4bb9ba0fad.poster.avif?t=1725219198\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754540/extras/7515d58d819f78ccfc198e4bb9ba0fad.webm?t=1725219198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754540/extras/7515d58d819f78ccfc198e4bb9ba0fad.mp4?t=1725219198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>4 unique locations with their own features and mechanics, as well as a calm and relaxing atmosphere will allow you together with the Fox to pass this way and reveal all the abilities of this little traveler.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754540/extras/4a9520e69c577a58dfb40030a565954c.poster.avif?t=1725219198\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754540/extras/4a9520e69c577a58dfb40030a565954c.webm?t=1725219198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754540/extras/4a9520e69c577a58dfb40030a565954c.mp4?t=1725219198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Go on a wonderful and cute adventure with the Fox and explore the magical world around you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754540/extras/1cfac85665cce8cabc27eddc664b0522.poster.avif?t=1725219198\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754540/extras/1cfac85665cce8cabc27eddc664b0522.webm?t=1725219198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754540/extras/1cfac85665cce8cabc27eddc664b0522.mp4?t=1725219198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Fox Quest is a puzzle game in which you use your ability to move between two dimensions to change one of them so that you can achieve a result in the other.<br>Move blocks, activate normal and magic mechanisms and help the fox to reach the goal!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754540/extras/7515d58d819f78ccfc198e4bb9ba0fad.poster.avif?t=1725219198\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754540/extras/7515d58d819f78ccfc198e4bb9ba0fad.webm?t=1725219198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754540/extras/7515d58d819f78ccfc198e4bb9ba0fad.mp4?t=1725219198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>4 unique locations with their own features and mechanics, as well as a calm and relaxing atmosphere will allow you together with the Fox to pass this way and reveal all the abilities of this little traveler.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754540/extras/4a9520e69c577a58dfb40030a565954c.poster.avif?t=1725219198\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754540/extras/4a9520e69c577a58dfb40030a565954c.webm?t=1725219198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754540/extras/4a9520e69c577a58dfb40030a565954c.mp4?t=1725219198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Go on a wonderful and cute adventure with the Fox and explore the magical world around you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754540/extras/1cfac85665cce8cabc27eddc664b0522.poster.avif?t=1725219198\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754540/extras/1cfac85665cce8cabc27eddc664b0522.webm?t=1725219198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754540/extras/1cfac85665cce8cabc27eddc664b0522.mp4?t=1725219198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
